{"name": "quantity-demo.mzn", "language": "minizinc", "label": "MiniZinc", "code": "% 手順4　個数と最大化\nvar 0..4: q;\nconstraint 2*q <= 8;\nsolve maximize q;\noutput [\"q = \", show(q), \"\\n\"];\n", "lines": ["<span class=\"co\">% 手順4　個数と最大化</span>", "<span class=\"dt\">var</span> <span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">..</span><span class=\"dv\">4</span>: q;", "<span class=\"kw\">constraint</span> <span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"op\">*</span>q <span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"dv\">8</span>;", "<span class=\"kw\">solve</span> <span class=\"kw\">maximize</span> q;", "<span class=\"kw\">output</span> [<span class=\"st\">&quot;q = &quot;</span>, <span class=\"fu\">show</span>(q), <span class=\"st\">&quot;</span><span class=\"sc\">\\n</span><span class=\"st\">&quot;</span>];"]}